<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK SEPT NET JUMPS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK SEPT NET JUMPS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.23 vs    0.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    6.71 vs    1.49</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 14.12 vs    8.09</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	22.54 vs   16.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 17.02 vs    8.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   29.70 vs   16.99</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		104.49 vs   66.27</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     174.96 vs  125.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
